Memoman wrote:
> 
> Hi people
> I've an AlphaServer 4100 with OSF1 4.0B my question is....
> How can I get the device files for a tape installed on my system?
> I need it to make a tar !!!
> Is there a command or tool to achieve this ???

Whenever DU installs on a machine it makes all local device files, tape
included. AFAIK, 4100 comes with TLZ07 or TLZ09. Those files should be there,
namely

/dev/nrmt0a
/dev/nrmt0l
/dev/nrmt0m
/dev/nrmt0h

/dev/rmt0a
/dev/rmt0l
/dev/rmt0m
/dev/rmt0h

IF NOT, then, assuming SCSI ID of the tape is 5, type:

cd /dev
./MAKEDEV tz5

That should do it.

Nix.




